As part of the vulnerability remediation activities for the KASH application, we need to upgrade the existing **Marvin framework libraries and base versions** to address the vulnerabilities identified in Nexus.

The KASH application is built on top of our internal **Marvin framework**, which is itself built on Spring Boot. Currently, we have the following Marvin components configured:

1. `marvin-spring-boot-base-run: 4.2.3`
